Changes: ROS 2 node/message/time/logger dependencies replaced by ROS 1 native
geometry/time and plain calculation types; C++17 constructs adapted to C++14;
node communications and debug markers removed; Pipeline owns input validation;
last-valid-trajectory reuse and solver fallback removed; computation failures throw;
base_link input paths transformed to map with the supplied ego pose;
PID dt bounds and control output units adapted to this workspace's contracts.
The default kinematics bicycle model with steering lag and OSQP solver is ported.
Operation mode is autonomous when this Core is selected. Steering offset is zero.
The moving/stopped/converged steering wrapper and next-cycle synchronization are retained.

OSQP 0.6.3: https://github.com/osqp/osqp/releases/tag/v0.6.3
Release source downloaded by CMake with a fixed SHA256; Apache License 2.0.
The ROS 2 OSQP wrapper is replaced by the native 0.6 C API, retaining warm starts.

