Port packing for this repository:
External MPC, PID, interpolation, geometry and motion utilities and TL expected
are copied from origin/fucked/taeyun, with include relocation only. Original
ROS 1 compatibility message definitions and scalar clamp preserve this external
port's calculation interface. External numerical bodies are unchanged.
Custom controller wrapper, parameter structures/defaults and OSQP C API adapter
are folded into cores/autoware_universe.hpp. Source coefficient checks are kept
in parameters/autoware_universe.hpp. License copies are preserved in ../licenses/.
